---
title: "Zanzibar Tours & Day Trips"
description: "Browse Zanzibar tours and day trips with marine fees included: Stone Town, spice farms, Safari Blue, Nakupenda, Jozani and more."
permalink: "/tours/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Zanzibar Tours & Day Trips</h1>
    <p class="page-meta">Book directly with Dhow Coast Travels in Zanzibar. All prices shown include marine park fees, guide fees, and transfers where applicable. WhatsApp-first booking — instant confirmation.</p>

    <nav class="tour-filters" aria-label="Filter tours by type">
      <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All Tours</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="CUL">Cultural Tours</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="MAR">Marine Excursions</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="NAT">Nature Activities</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="SAF">Safari Day Trips</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="PKG">Packages</button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="cards tour-grid">
    {% for tour in tours %}
      <article class="card tour-card reveal" data-category="{{ tour.category }}">
        <div class="card-image">
          {% set imgFile = __slugMap[tour.slug] or __slugMap[tour.seo_slug] or "default-tour-hero.jpg" %}
          <img src="/images/{{ imgFile }}" alt="{{ tour.title }}" class="tour-card-image" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="tour-category">{{ tour.category }}</span>
          <h3><a href="/tours/{{ tour.seo_slug }}/">{{ tour.title }}</a></h3>
          <p class="tour-meta">{{ tour.duration }} • {{ tour.location }}</p>
          <p class="tour-description">{{ tour.short_description }}</p>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <span class="card-price">{{ tour.price.display }} <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
            <a href="/tours/{{ tour.seo_slug }}/" class="btn btn-sm">Details & Booking</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>

  <section class="transfer-link">
    <h2>Need Airport Transfers?</h2>
    <p>Private transfers from Abeid Amani Karume Airport (ZNZ) to Stone Town, Nungwi, Kendwa, Paje, Jambiani, and all zones.</p>
    <a href="/transfers/" class="btn primary">View Transfer Options</a>
  </section>

  <section class="tour-faq">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions about Zanzibar Tours</h2>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Do I need to book tours in advance?</summary>
      <p>For popular activities (Safari Blue, Mnemba snorkeling, Jozani Forest), book 1–3 days ahead in peak season. Stone Town walks and spice tours can often be arranged same-day.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Can I customize tour durations?</summary>
      <p>Yes — most tours are flexible. Morning or afternoon departures, add visits, extend to full-day. WhatsApp us to discuss.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Are marine park fees included?</summary>
      <p>Yes — Menai Bay ($10) and Mnemba ($25) conservation fees are included in our tour prices. Other entry fees (museums, Jozani park) are noted where not included.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What if the weather is bad?</summary>
      <p>Marine tours may be rescheduled for safety. We offer flexible rebooking or full refunds if conditions prevent departure.</p>
    </details>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
